    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no way to break it. anything i do just gets swallowed up by the company. even if i take a day off or try something new, i'm still just coming back to the same warehouse on monday. it's like the system is designed so that you can't actually win. there's no real way to be free from it.",
